      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Church_Creek%2C_Maryland"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Historically, the town’s economy grew from the traffic that crossed its crossroads of Taylor’s Island Road (Route 16) and Church Creek‑Golden Hill Road (Route 335).",
